---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-[#252c38] bg-[#0b0d11] text-gray-400 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <a href={`${base}/`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brass-300 hover:text-brass-200 transition-colors font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2">
          <span>⚙️</span> CHARLES BABBAGE DIGITAL ARCHIVE
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          컴퓨터의 아버지 찰스 배비지(1791–1871)의 생애와 업적, 유한차분법 기계 및 해석기관의 원문 사료와 에이다 러브레이스의 알고리즘을 체계적으로 보존·해설하는 디지털 아카이브입니다.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-gray-500">
          <span>영국 런던 과학박물관 사료 대조</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Public Domain 1차 문헌 기반</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-200 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">주요 탐색</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href={`${base}/biography`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">생애 연표 (1791–1871)</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/difference-engine`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">차분기관 1·2호와 유한차분법</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/analytical-engine`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">해석기관과 튜링 완전성</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/ada-lovelace`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">에이다 러브레이스와 베르누이 수</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/economy-philosophy`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">배비지 원칙과 브리지워터 논문</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-200 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">1차 사료 아카이브</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href={`${base}/sources#passages`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">자서전 (Passages, 1864)</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/sources#lovelace`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">에이다 주석 논문 (Notes, 1843)</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/sources#economy`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">기계제조업 경제학 (1832)</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/sources#diff1822`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">차분기관 발표 논문 (1822)</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/sources#bridgewater`} class="hover:text-brass-300 transition-colors">제9 브리지워터 논문 (1837)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-gray-800/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-gray-500 text-center sm:text-left">
      <p>© 1822–1871 Charles Babbage Works (Public Domain). Curation & Digital Platform Open Source.</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] max-w-xl">"The Analytical Engine weaves algebraical patterns just as the Jacquard-loom weaves flowers and leaves." — Ada Lovelace, 1843</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
